            </note>
            <note corresp="#d246-f2" n="24" xml:id="d246-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram 2152, September 7, 7 p.m., to Moscow, <ref target="#pg224">p.
                        224</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d246-f3" n="25" xml:id="d246-f3-content">
                <p>Vyacheslav Mikhailovich Molotov, People’s Commissar for Foreign Affairs of the
                    Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
